Generate {{ num_docs }} English texts simulating corrupted structured data (CSV, JSON, XML, logs) containing PII.

## Purpose
Measure PII detection in broken data pipeline output — a common production scenario.

## Rules
- Mark PII entities with XML tags:
  - <PERSON>name</PERSON>
  - <ADDRESS>address</ADDRESS>
  - <ORGANIZATION>organization</ORGANIZATION>
  - <DATE_OF_BIRTH>date of birth</DATE_OF_BIRTH>
  - <BANK_ACCOUNT>bank account info</BANK_ACCOUNT>

## Corruption patterns

