## Confusing expressions (NO tags)
- Field names: "name", "addr", "dob", "bank"
- Timestamps: "2024-03-15T10:30:22Z"
- HTML tags: <div>, <span>, <br>
- Log levels: WARN, INFO, ERROR
- Email headers: From, To, Subject

## Output format
Separate each text with `---DOC_SEPARATOR---`.
